  "post_content": "<p>M&aacute;s de cien expositores se pod&iacute;an visitar hoy en Tales, en el Mercat Tradicional-Fira de Nadal, que ha estado muy animado a causa del buen tiempo.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2011/12/IMG_43151.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>Durante todo el d&iacute;a se han ido sucediendo tambi&eacute;n las actuaciones como la del Grup Folc&ograve;ric d&#39;Onda o la Asociaci&oacute;n de Tambores y Bombos de Tales (esta &uacute;ltima en muchas de las fotos).</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p><div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/firanadaltales/img_4269.jpg\" alt=\"img_4269\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/firanadaltales/img_4270.jpg\" alt=\"img_4270\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/firanadaltales/img_4271.jpg\" alt=\"img_4271\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/firanadaltales/img_4272.jpg\" alt=\"img_4272\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/firanadaltales/img_4273.jpg\" alt=\"img_4273\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/firanadaltales/img_4274.jpg\" alt=\"img_4274\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/firanadaltales/img_4275.jpg\" alt=\"img_4275\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/firanadaltales/img_4276.jpg\" alt=\"img_4276\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/firanadaltales/img_4277.jpg\" alt=\"img_4277\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto